A speedy kill is important to prevent getting so many insects they block
any attack.  First have max skill at a multifire missile class.  Start
with that class.  Never be burdened when firing.  I've forgotten to
avoid being burdened and neded up in a crowd of insects.

> Next, the priest comes over and kills my character.

That's not possible.  Priests do not leave their altar so they say one
square from the altar.  A shrine wall is dug out to a distance by your
maximum throwing range.  The priest never leaves the altar and the diety
only throws lightning and disintegration inside the shrine so missile
attacks only happen from a dug out location.

The down side of insects is if you get so many you know you won't be
able to kill the priest you give up and wade through insects to the up
stairs.  Killing a shrine priest should only be done when you're strong
enough to wade through bees and ants and you're outside of the shrine.

> The safest method is to lure the priest away from the altar and then
> to boulder them up.

Second after having your pet kill the priest.  I've tried the boulder
trick and I concluded it takes less patience to lug every missile in the
mines to a dug out location.

Done right the result is a priest generating infinite insects so it's
wonderful for an extended sacrifest.

